## 2. Project Overview

Retail-X-AI is an AI-powered decision support system focused on retail inventory management. The system is intended to help shop owners and managers understand historical retail behaviour, detect inventory risk, generate demand forecasts, and receive actionable restocking recommendations.

The solution is designed to support:

- sales and inventory tracking
- product analysis
- demand forecasting
- stockout risk detection
- smart restocking suggestions
- interactive AI-based assistance
- operational dashboards and reporting

The system is intended to be practical, understandable, and scalable for small retail operations while remaining grounded in the actual available dataset and approved business rules.

